  "claim_ceiling": "RTDL currently provides two fixed protocol constructors over two physical geometry kinds plus one bounded user-authored built-in-triangle u32x3 template. Its public routes instantiate two of six OptiX 9 build-input enum kinds and two of four leaf-primitive kinds; this is kind-presence only, not feature-complete category support. The application-semantic protocol universe is open; prospective frozen-core new-shape exams remain zero."
